,"text":"손 데이터는 기기 밖으로 내보내지 않습니다."}]},{"type":"text","text":" 관절 좌표와 카메라 프레임을 파일·로그·네트워크·분석 도구 어디에도 남기지 않습니다. 학습 데이터를 모을 때도 좌표가 아니라 익명화된 특징 벡터만 남깁니다."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"HandTrackingFeed.swift","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 앵커 하나를 ","type":"text"},{"code":"HandSample","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"로","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","code":["import ARKit","import simd","import OSLog","import QuartzCore","","@MainActor","final class HandTrackingFeed: HandFeed {","    \/\/ …","","    private func handle(_ anchor: HandAnchor) {","        guard anchor.isTracked,","              anchor.chirality == preferredChirality,","              let skeleton = anchor.handSkeleton,","              let feature = PoseFeature.extract(from: skeleton, chirality: anchor.chirality)","        else { return }","","        let wrist = skeleton.joint(.wrist).anchorFromJointTransform","        let knuckle = skeleton.joint(.middleFingerKnuckle).anchorFromJointTransform","        let span = length((wrist.inverse * knuckle).columns.3.xyz)","","        continuation?.yield(","            HandSample(feature: feature,","                       chirality: anchor.chirality,","                       wristTransform: anchor.originFromAnchorTransform * wrist,","                       handSpan: span,","                       timestamp: CACurrentMediaTime())","        )","    }","}"],"lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}]},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}]},{"range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":26},{"line":26}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":27},{"line":27}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":28},{"line":28}]}],"showLineNumbers":false},{"text":"6.3","level":3,"anchor":"63","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"왼손은 특징 추출 단계에서 x축을 뒤집어, 오른손 기준표 하나로 판정합니다. 기준 포즈를 두 벌 만들 필요가 없습니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseFeature.swift"}]},{"text":" — 왼손을 오른손으로 뒤집기","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["import ARKit","import simd","","struct PoseFeature: Equatable, Codable, Sendable {","    static func extract(from skeleton: HandSkeleton,","                        chirality: HandAnchor.Chirality = .right) -> PoseFeature? {","        \/\/ …","","        let mirror: Float = (chirality == .left) ? -1 : 1","","        func local(_ name: HandSkeleton.JointName) -> SIMD3<Float> {","            let m = toLocal * skeleton.joint(name).anchorFromJointTransform","            var p = m.columns.3.xyz","            p.x *= mirror","            return p","        }","        \/\/ …","    }","}"],"lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]}],"showLineNumbers":false},{"text":"6.4","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"64"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"정답 손 모양을 반투명 뼈대로 겹칩니다. 오차가 큰 관절만 진하게 만드는데, 색을 하나 더 쓰는 대신 ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"투명도","type":"text"}]},{"text":"로 구분해 색맹 사용자도 읽을 수 있게 합니다. 진하기의 기준은 ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"관절마다 다른 허용 오차","type":"text"}]},{"text":"입니다 — 약지·새끼를 관대하게 보는 글자에서 그 두 손가락이 늘 진하게 보이면, 사용자는 고칠 수 없는 것을 고치려 듭니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"GuideOverlay.swift","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — 오차가 큰 관절만 진하게","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","code":["import UIKit","import RealityKit","import simd","","@MainActor","final class GuideOverlay {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 관절마다 허용 오차가 다르다. 약지·새끼를 관대하게 보는 글자에서","    \/\/\/ 그 두 손가락이 늘 진하게 보이면 사용자는 고칠 수 없는 것을 고치려 든다.","    func highlight(_ errors: [Float], tolerances: [Float]) {","        for (i, bone) in bones.enumerated() where i < errors.count {","            let tolerance = i < tolerances.count ? tolerances[i] : 0.26","            let over = min(errors[i] \/ max(tolerance, 1e-4), 2)","            bone.components.set(","                ModelComponent(mesh: boneMesh,","                               materials: [Self.material(opacity: 0.15 + 0.35 * over)])","            )","        }","    }","}"],"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}]}],"showLineNumbers":false},{"text":"6.5","level":3,"anchor":"65","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"겹쳐 보기와 나란히 보기를 ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"둘 다","type":"text"}]},{"text":" 만들고 사용자가 고르게 합니다. 초심자는 나란히 두는 쪽을, 교정 단계에서는 겹치는 쪽을 선호하는 경향이 있습니다.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GuideOverlay.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 손목에 맞춰 세우기"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","code":["import UIKit","import RealityKit","import simd","","@MainActor","final class GuideOverlay {","    \/\/ …","","    func align(wrist: simd_float4x4, span: Float, mode: Mode) {","        var t = Transform(matrix: wrist)","        t.scale = SIMD3(repeating: max(span \/ 0.09, 0.5))","        if mode == .sideBySide {","            \/\/ 손 오른쪽 12cm 옆에 나란히 세운다.","            t.translation += SIMD3(0.12, 0, 0)","        }","        root.transform = t","    }","}"],"lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"}],"showLineNumbers":false},{"text":"6.6","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"66"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"몰입 공간에 뼈대를 올립니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 화면은 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityView"},{"type":"text","text":" 하나와 시작·정지 두 줄이 전부입니다. 손 추적이 몰입 공간에서만 동작하므로, 공간이 열릴 때 시작하고 닫힐 때 멈추는 것이 자연스러운 수명입니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PracticeSpace.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 몰입 공간"}]},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"code":["import RealityKit","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ 손 스켈레톤 추적은 몰입 공간에서만 동작한다.","struct PracticeSpace: View {","    @Environment(TutorModel.self) private var model","","    var body: some View {","        RealityView { content in","            content.add(model.overlay.root)","        }","        .task {","            await model.start()","        }","        .onDisappear {","            model.stop()","        }","    }","}"],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":4},{"line":4}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":5},{"line":5}]},{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"}],"wrap":0},{"level":3,"text":"실행 결과","anchor":"%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"6단계 실행 화면"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":